# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Platform boilerplate (100% auto-generated by `flutter create`, no manual
# customization) and binary launcher icons are not tracked in this repo — the
# available GitHub API path here can't push binary files without corrupting
# them. Regenerate locally with: flutter create --platforms=android,ios .
/android/
/ios/
/web/favicon.png
/web/icons/
